    "name": "SetuMoolya API v2.0 — Admin | Farmer | Buyer",
    "description": "Complete API test collection for SetuMoolya backend.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. OTP → Send & Verify (get phone_verified_token)\n2. Farmer/Buyer → Register (with photo)\n3. Admin → Login → Dashboard → Approve/Reject\n4. Farmer/Buyer → Login with approved credentials\n5. Farmer/Buyer → View Profile\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:5000",
