            "description": "Approve the farmer's registration request.\n\n**What happens on approval:**\n1. A Supabase Auth user is created\n2. A unique login email is generated (e.g. rameshkumar123456@setumoolya.com)\n3. A secure random password is generated\n4. The profile is saved in the profiles table\n5. An approval email is sent with login_id + password + login link\n6. The request status is updated to 'approved'\n\nThe generated `login_id` is saved to the collection variable for the Farmer Login step."
          },
